TIP:  This is one of those rare songs that begins with a (Bm).  So try starting off with a full "(BmB)" using a barre across the 2nd fret.  Form up in the 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 pattern, then lift off the index finger and lay it across the 2nd fret.  (Bm) will come along again later in the song and you can play it without the barre.  


